WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:04.460
Another thing Dr. Bright is not allowed to
do at the Foundation: Dr. Bright!

00:00:04.460 --> 00:00:07.859
The Foundation Motto is Not "Let's Use it
on 682!"

00:00:07.859 --> 00:00:13.919
Dr. Bright is to be reminded that the Foundation's
only official motto is Secure, Contain, Protect.

00:00:13.919 --> 00:00:17.590
It is not, in fact, any of the alternatives
he has suggested.

00:00:17.590 --> 00:00:19.439
This includes but is not limited to:

00:00:19.439 --> 00:00:21.130
"Can we put it in 914?"

00:00:21.130 --> 00:00:24.000
"Blood makes the grass grow, kill, kill, kill!"

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:26.279
"Throw D-Class at it until it stops."

00:00:26.279 --> 00:00:28.849
"When in doubt, feed it to 682."

00:00:28.849 --> 00:00:32.080
"Slapstick, Clowns and Puns," or "Snap Crackle
and Pop."

00:00:32.080 --> 00:00:37.540
That last one got us served a cease and desist
from Kellogg's, and we can't afford a lawsuit

00:00:37.540 --> 00:00:38.540
right now.

00:00:38.540 --> 00:00:39.890
Cut it out!

